OL,3,ACreate more jobs for under-25s by
OL,4,Acutting National Insurance, key report
OL,5,Aurges
OL,6,
OL,7,FTo help create more jobs for under-25s,
OL,8,Fnational Insurance (NI) paid by
OL,9,Fbusinesses on these workers should be
OL,10,Fgradually lowered, a major report will
OL,11,Furge.
OL,13,FThere are nearly one million16-24
OL,14,Fyear-olds not in employment, education
OL,15,For training (Neets) in the UK, official
OL,16,Ffigures show.
OL,18,FReducing NI costs for firms starting
OL,19,Fwith retail and hospitality firms -
OL,20,Fwhich provide almost 40% of jobs for
OL,21,Fthese people - will help improve their
OL,22,Fopportunities, the report will suggest.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
