OL,3,AUK lost more than it gained from
OL,4,ABrexit, Burnham to say ahead of EU
OL,5,Asummit
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister is expected to argue
OL,8,Fthe UK has lost more than it has gained
OL,9,Ffrom leaving the European Union in a
OL,10,Fspeech ahead of a UK-EU summit later
OL,11,Fthis week.
OL,13,FSpeaking at the Lord Mayor's Banquet on
OL,14,FMonday, Andy Burnham will compare the
OL,15,FUK's Brexit deal to the "emperor's new
OL,16,Fclothes" - saying "a needlessly hard
OL,17,FBrexit" created barriers for businesses
OL,18,Fand the promise to "take back control"
OL,19,Fwas not delivered.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
