OL,3,AAustralian MP 'full of gratitude' upon
OL,4,Aleaving hospital after alleged car
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralian politician Helen Haines has
OL,8,Fsaid she is "full of gratitude" upon
OL,9,Fbeing discharged from hospital, four
OL,10,Fweeks after she was allegedly attacked
OL,11,Fwith a car and left a double amputee.
OL,13,FThe independent MP was struck outside
OL,14,Fher electorate office in Wangaratta,
OL,15,Fnorth-east of Melbourne, on October 19,
OL,16,Fan incident which horrified Australia.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
